{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GM:statement", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nIf <MATH_0002> is flat, locally of finite presentation, and for every <MATH_0003>\nthe fibre <MATH_0004> is a disjoint union of spectra of finite separable\nfield extensions of <MATH_0005>, then <MATH_0006> is <ACCENT_0001>tale.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$s \\in S$", "MATH_0004": "$X_s$", "MATH_0005": "$\\kappa(s)$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "ACCENT_0001": "\\'e"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-flat-etale-fibres}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:ff8dbd57570a49454be8853276355e4974fa3b59475293c5081ffaf6812dea12", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f4214c23648216497a82b3fc89f76220c9c4d11e187cacc1d0b60fe96b8cd45a", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3b8525fba3716e277f4373f95530fa1a92645364e978b82cd48abc30740fa810"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GM:proof", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "You can deduce this from\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nHere is another proof.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nBy Lemma <REF_0002> a fibre <MATH_0001> is <ACCENT_0001>tale\nand hence smooth over <MATH_0002>. By Lemma <REF_0003>\nwe see that <MATH_0003> is smooth.\nBy Lemma <REF_0004>\nwe see that <MATH_0004> is unramified. We conclude by\nLemma <REF_0005>.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-characterize-etale}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-etale-over-field}", "MATH_0001": "$X_s$", "ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0002": "$s$", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-smooth-flat-smooth-fibres}", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to S$", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-unramified-etale-fibres}", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-etale-smooth-unramified}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:b60144db4f43657b5314076e04c71ce1c5d1753542bd4cc623e12292066856a7", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:23fb8aaaead109599273b1e78b19ce0e080e40ae17d0f6f8ff2b46f0ca417365", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6aeff90303c742aa9c93a0069dabd1d71869e3ebaced2728fcf8b85f1f1dd478"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GP:statement", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Any open immersion is <ACCENT_0001>tale.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-open-immersion-etale}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:9f709b33309840bac0dbd0893c343824a763e075e64e4c42151975e1dbc4bf97", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3778fe3c44fa375714a0ef199b512c0220bdf8471297a3d572ef3d02383a458e", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GP:proof", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "This is true because an open immersion is a local isomorphism.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:acb4ec29b81aa746a58aa6944bf2eb44b4cbbc3550be451946e31155b346a9c6", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c49f47c744907a5e08d084001fb07bc555149a036235905c0f71b324b0f1af31", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GQ:statement", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "An <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism is syntomic.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-syntomic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:9b2f350415bfcab943dba46c2db76c32c43db70785076dc181e47ee9325ef237", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2f4a802ce9bd02f1f70bbc7e09e826c64679e140c39e1dda6ba2e88168f7df99", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GQ:proof", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "See Algebra, Lemma <REF_0001> and use that an\n<ACCENT_0001>tale morphism is the same as a smooth morphism of relative dimension <MATH_0001>.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-smooth-syntomic}", "ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$0$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:540754b16ff4cef45f910b57772ca43bbd2954d94079d8b68a1f52516ed47df5", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3cbb59f869cecabcb9bf5ab7c3214c518f44feedfab624d2299c7867b8082e88", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3fa23b0b63474bb791fe77aa109d46b4825e3d9a88d0b113ae1aff7badeef846"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GR:statement", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "An <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism is locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-locally-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:e9a79b73970ee0023e556c42619539febba6f5f2255aaa24767989652c940310", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:04a9596be2cafb93d6364a3b38d16a2d934bb5f31aa92d86ec12184138cd87e7", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02GR:proof", "parent_tag": "02GH", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "True because an <ACCENT_0001>tale ring map is of finite presentation by\ndefinition.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:5139ac28cc232e7fe699330f606e3552146eea752a4e6d2acb820c2bbdfd1b51", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:adc3fe1d8a3ec35ef1918a8a3647eccf2c510891485b4efc750faca8548ff171", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
